  "features": [
    "All twelve linked native module factory headers execute from Home-owned copies with complete inventory rejection.",
    "Standalone native Buffer implementation and encoding/list helpers compile from Home with exact linked class-header ABI validation.",
    "The native module unity is fully Home-owned, including terminal and object-module generation.",
    "JS2Native dispatch compiles from Home; generated dispatch bodies/IDs remain byte-identical while factory includes share the owned headers."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Existing Home buffer.transcode routing is preserved; the Buffer source adds an extern-template declaration for typed-array ClassInfo supplied by the linked JSC library.",
    "Earlier generator unit/path mistakes, deadline expiration, duplicate declaration, dispatch include and template diagnostics remain without final passing credit.",
    "This verifies ordinary Buffer/decoder/constants/module/TTY APIs, not all Buffer behavior or complete native dependency ownership. Full suite and Release/ASAN/all-platform verification remain open under #66."
  ],
